        "subject": "Milestone 8 — Semantic/Vector Retrieval",
        "description": {
          "format": "markdown",
          "raw": "Gated on measurement rather than on machinery.\n\n**Before choosing a backend:** build an evaluation corpus of real questions with known answers, and measure lexical retrieval against it first.\n\n**Implement only if** the measurement shows a gap that lexical search cannot close, and keep the ports as seams either way.",
          "html": "<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Gated on measurement rather than on machinery.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Before choosing a backend:</strong> build an evaluation corpus of real questions with known answers, and measure lexical retrieval against it first.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Implement only if</strong> the measurement shows a gap that lexical search cannot close, and keep the ports as seams either way.</p>"
        },
