        "subject": "Milestone 10 — Maintenance Automation",
        "description": {
          "format": "markdown",
          "raw": "**Implement:** a periodic maintenance scheduler; stale detection; orphan analysis; broken-link reports; and a summary a person can act on.\n\nEvery check reports and never repairs on its own. A repair is a separate, explicit request with a dry run first.\n\n**Done when** a week of scheduled runs produces findings and changes nothing in the vault.",
          "html": "<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Implement:</strong> a periodic maintenance scheduler; stale detection; orphan analysis; broken-link reports; and a summary a person can act on.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Every check reports and never repairs on its own. A repair is a separate, explicit request with a dry run first.</p>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><strong>Done when</strong> a week of scheduled runs produces findings and changes nothing in the vault.</p>"
        },
